OL,3,AN Korea has built two-storey uranium
OL,4,Aenrichment facility, says watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Korea has built a new two-storey
OL,7,Furanium enrichment facility, the head
OL,8,Fof the world's nuclear watchdog said
OL,9,Fthis week, calling it a cause for
OL,10,F"serious concern".
OL,12,FThe new building is part of the main
OL,13,FYongbyon nuclear complex, and
OL,14,Freportedly capable of housing up to 28
OL,15,Fcentrifuge cascades used to enrich
OL,16,Furanium.
OL,18,FIn a report published late last month,
OL,19,Fthe International Atomic Energy Agency
OL,20,F(IAEA) said Pyongyang had also begun
OL,21,Foperating an expanded annex at another
OL,22,Fenrichment site.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
