OL,3,AN Korea has built two-storey uranium
OL,4,Aenrichment facility, says watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FThese findings point to a steady
OL,7,Fexpansion of the North's sancitoned
OL,8,Fnuclear infrastructure. The agency,
OL,9,Fwhich has no inspectors in North Korea
OL,10,Fsince it was expelled in 2009, relies
OL,11,Fon satellite imagery for assessments.
